# Pranast Website — Cursor Rules

> Full persona & architectural philosophy: `GEMINI.md`
> Full architecture map, schema refs, coding standards: `CLAUDE.md`

## Commands
```sh
npm run dev      # Astro dev server (localhost:4321)
npm run build    # SSG build → dist/ + copies to repo root
npm run check    # TS + Astro content schema validation
npm run preview  # Preview built output
```

## Stack
- Astro 7 · SSG · Islands architecture · zero client-JS by default
- Tailwind CSS v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite` (no `tailwind.config.js`)
- TypeScript strict · path alias `@/*` → `src/*`
- Deploy: GitHub Actions → FTPS → Hostinger `public_html/`

## Key Paths
| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `src/content/` | Markdown source — blog/, case-studies/, pages/ |
| `src/content.config.ts` | Zod schemas for all 3 collections |
| `src/pages/` | Astro routes (index, [...slug], blog/, case-studies/) |
| `src/components/` | Header, Footer, ContactForm, FaqAccordion, BridgeADTabs |
| `src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro` | Root HTML shell + global SEO meta |
| `astro.config.mjs` | Site config (output: static, Vite plugins) |
| `dist/` | Build output — **never edit manually** |

## Rules
- Content edits → `.md` files in `src/content/` only; never touch `dist/`
- After schema changes → `npm run check`
- After code changes → `npm run build`; confirm `dist/index.html` exists
- No client-side JS unless required; use `client:load` / `client:idle` sparingly
- Never edit `package-lock.json` directly
- Surgical edits only — prefer minimal diffs over file rewrites

